#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0554-D expect=noViolation domain=APAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when, in an Associated Persons dataset (DOMAIN starting with AP), APID is not present.
#note "AP-domain positive control, added by the R-5.25 wave-3 split: DOMAIN=APAE (prefix AP) and the APID column is present -> the associated-persons identifier requirement is satisfied"
dataset APAE label="Associated Persons AE"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col APID type=Char label="Associated Persons Identifier"
col APSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | APAE | AP-001 | 1
---
